# Generated outputs, traces and caches (never upload)
# runs/ stays local except two small records that the code reads:
# the judge calibration record and the Stage B checkpoint sidecar.
runs/*
!runs/distill/
runs/distill/*
!runs/distill/calibration-v1/
runs/distill/calibration-v1/*
!runs/distill/calibration-v1/calibration-record.json
!runs/distill/stage-b/
